Subject: [PATCH] fix(worker): bound real inventory to account board roots
 [daveey]

Standalone live proofs set HERMES_HOME but deliberately retain the immutable account policy root. The previous pytest-only guard therefore registered scratch running rows into real host admission. Restrict producer registration and census reads to canonical resolved account default, named and profile boards; retain isolated policy fixtures and read-only legacy filtering.

Proof: original implementation fails 6 boundary cases; changed implementation passes all 103 tests across six inventory, retirement, scope and alarm files. scripts/check --base origin/main: 20 checks OK. Task t_01a1d77dbaa06a31; live replay and independent review still required before landing.
